title: empty_cargo_start
tags: 
---
You find a small cargo pod floating in space. It seems intact. #line:empty_cargo_start_00
-> Open It #line:empty_cargo_start_01
    <<if roll(100) <= 50>>
    <<jump empty_cargo_cargo_good>>
    <<elseif roll(100) <= 80>>
    <<jump empty_cargo_cargo_trap>>
    <<else>>
    <<jump empty_cargo_cargo_empty>>
    <<endif>>
===

title: empty_cargo_cargo_good
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_success>>
The pod contains valuable supplies! #line:empty_cargo_cargo_good_00
-> Take It #line:empty_cargo_cargo_good_01
    <<give_credits 150>>
    <<remove_body>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: empty_cargo_cargo_trap
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_fail>>
The pod was rigged! It explodes near your hull! #line:empty_cargo_cargo_trap_00
-> Damage Report #line:empty_cargo_cargo_trap_01
    <<damage_ship 10>>
    <<remove_body>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: empty_cargo_cargo_empty
tags: 
---
The pod is empty. Someone got here first. #line:empty_cargo_cargo_empty_00
-> Continue #line:empty_cargo_cargo_empty_01
    <<remove_body>>
    <<stop>>
===

